  "repo_truth": "Supplemental run p2-evidence-evaluator-planning-supplemental-causal-1 closed rollback resistance but found one causal P2: transaction-directory failures precede sequence-bearing observations. The parent added an always-first evidence_transaction_store observation with fixed selector/logical ID, retained_directory observation kind, canonical platform-tagged raw-filename inventory fingerprint, exact nullability/error codes, and absent/unsafe/read/invalid/alias/over-limit proof vectors. Production/test bytes remain unchanged at 00dde01. This is the second and final supplemental causal cycle. P2 runtime, P4's separate negative-surface proof, P6, Phase 2 exit, and HCM-3.x remain closed.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Read-only replay of the complete 23-entry final supplemental manifest and comparison with subject 0dd4af5a.",
    "Delta-focused closure of exactly p2-evidence-evaluator-planning-supplemental-causal-1-P2-1.",
    "Verify the transaction-store observation is schema-total, deterministic, ordered first, byte-binding, and covered by exact vectors.",
    "Report only a directly caused or unmasked P1/P2 inside that remediation; no open-ended discovery."
  ],
  "non_goals": [
    "No edits, formatting, staging, commit, push, handoff, ledger, dispatch, or delegation.",
    "No approval or implementation of P2 runtime/schema/definition/native adapter/Environment Context or P6.",
    "No reopening previously closed findings absent a demonstrated remediation-caused P1/P2.",
    "No P4 negative-surface work and no unrelated .claude, AGENTS.md, or CLAUDE.md paths."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Verify manifest and final supplemental aggregate identity.",
    "Confirm the exact evidence_transaction_store kind, fixed logical ID/ref, first-row ordering, retained_directory canonical raw-name inventory, nullability, error enum, and closure fingerprint binding.",
    "Confirm absent, unsafe, unreadable, invalid-entry, alias, and over-limit store vectors are selected and replayably distinct.",
    "Confirm coupled status remains documentation-only, human-gated, and does not promote P4/P6/Phase 2.",
    "Return findings first in Critical, Required, Optional, Nit order with exact file/line, violated contract, why wrong, smallest remediation, and missing verification."
  ],
  "contracts_and_gates": [
    "Planning/documentation only; no runtime authorization",
    "Every transaction-store failure has one schema-conforming first observation row",
    "Retained directory names bind to a canonical platform-tagged raw-name inventory fingerprint",
    "All previous discovery/closure/supplemental findings remain closed",
    "Released definitions/fingerprints and production/test bytes remain unchanged",
    "No review cycle remains after this final supplemental causal cycle",
    "P2A still requires non-production feasibility and a second human production-adapter decision",
